First task, register new phone number by send an sms to the sim800l which containing a permanent security code (12345) that allows the number to register in service then send an sms back to sender that containing (registery corfirmed + ask for an ID with maximum 15 chars) for this recently registered phone number then wait 3 minute for recevie the replay sms from that recently registered number containing (custom ID in maximum 15 chars) and then save ID for that phone number also ID case is not sensitive, otherwise if replied ID longer than 15 chars then sim800l must send back an sms containing (ask for an ID with maximum 15 chars), but if the phone number sent wrong the security code then can not register in service and sim800l send an sms back (registery failed) sms back to the sender phone number, maximum register space is 10 phone numbers, also if any registered phone number try to reregister then ignore from system.

second task, if a registered number call the sim800l then sim800l must respond with rejection response to the incoming phone call and then send sms containing (security activated + current registered caller saved ID) to the previous caller and the first registered number both also set digital pin 2 HIGH (sensor module power relay) until another phone call receive from any registered number and then send an sms containing (security deactivated + current registered caller saved ID) to the previous caller and another but exact same text to the first registerd phone number as well also set digital pin 2 LOW until the next phone call from a registered phone number.

Third task, if digital pin 3 on arduino pro mini is HIGH (a signal from sensor module) then sim800l must call to the last registered number that made a call with sim800l for a period of 20 seconds also send single sms to each registered phone numbers that containing a text (intruder) also set digital pin 4 HIGH (siren module power relay) plus set digital pin 5 (left flash LED power relay) HIGH for 50 miliseconds then set LOW and delays 200 miliseconds then set digital pin 6 (right flash LED power relay) HIGH for 50 miliseconds then set LOW and delays 200 miliseconds as well and this alternative two HIGH and LOW cycle of 5 and 6 digital pins must be continue until digital pin 4 sets LOW, if the call from sim800l to the last registered caller is not successful (destination number is out of antenna or turned off) or after 20 seconds results in no respond from registered phone number then make a new call but this time to the first registered phone number, if there is no respond or not successful then make another call to the next registered phone number, if trying to call with each registered phone numbers results in no respond or not successful then again from the first to the last registered phone number must try to call and this cycle continues for 10 times maximum, if there is only one registered phone number available (first registered phone number) then the calling cycle repeats 10 times for that phone number as well as multi registered phone numbers situation, if the call from sim800l is answered from registered phone number then set digital pin 2 (sensor module power relay) LOW also set digital pin 4 (siren module power relay) LOW then send single sms containing (security deactivate + last registered caller ID) to each registered caller phone numbers,but if the call rejected from registered phone number then send single sms to each registered phone numbers that contain a text (call the police) also digital pin 4 keeps in HIGH state for further 60 minutes, if a phone call recieved from a registered phone number during digital pin 4 HIGH state then send multiple sms containing (security deactivated + current registered caller ID) to all registered phone numbers plus 2 and 4 digital pins sets LOW.

Forth task, if a registered phone number send an sms containing (status) in the text,then send an sms to that number which containing a text following one of these status, if the digital pin 2 in HIGH state then send (security activated) text to the sender or if the digital pin 2 in LOW state then send (security deactivated) back to the sender.

Fifth task, if the first registered phone number send an sms containing (list) then all (registered numbers + saved ID) sorted by first registered to last registered one by one in seprated smses back to the sender phone number and the first registered phone number can delete a registered phone number by send an sms containing (universal phone number format) to the sim800l, if the first registered phone number delete its own number the the next registered phone number take the place as the first registerd phone number.

Sixth task, if digital pin 13 (adapter power supply signal) turns in the HIGH state then send an sms to the first registered phone number containing (power gain), if digital pin 13 turns in LOW state then send an sms to the first registered phone number containing (power loss).

Seventh task, if the first registerd phone number send an sms containing (reset) then sim800l send an sms to the first registered phone number containing the text (reset factory?) Then wait 1 minute to respond, if the first registered phone number before 1 minute send an sms containing (yes) then all registered phone numbers and IDs plus all saved sms must erased, otherwise any other text should not count until 1 minute and then reseting sequence should be cancle, if erasing sequence complete then the device ready for new first and further registerations.

Eighth task, treshold of saved smses is 50 and if it goes over then delete oldest sms to regulate smses count back to 50 for enough space for taking proper functions.
